WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.561
Welcome to our training on lithium batteries.

00:00:02.561 --> 00:00:08.780
In this video, we'll show you the hazards of lithium batteries, give you the information you need

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:15.000
to sell lithium batteries in the Amazon store, and list the most common types of lithium batteries.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.857
Lithium batteries are widely used in electronic products, including phones, flashlights, laptops,

00:00:21.857 --> 00:00:23.000
and cameras.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.429
They can enter an uncontrollable self-heating state and ignite if they're damaged, dropped, crushed,

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:32.000
short circuited, or exposed to heat.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.250
For this reason, you're required to follow rules for transporting products with batteries when selling

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.000
them in the Amazon store.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.000
We expect all sellers to partner with us to help keep our employees, carriers, and customers safe.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:53.143
You must provide information about the batteries you intend to sell, including their type, weight,

00:00:53.143 --> 00:00:56.000
quantity, composition, and number of cells.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
You can add these details under battery information when you create or convert an FBA listing.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.480
Amazon may send you an email, requiring you to complete a safety data sheet or an exemption sheet

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:12.000
if your product is missing required information.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.095
You'll be expected to upload the sheet to the Manage Dangerous Goods Classification page in Seller

00:01:18.095 --> 00:01:20.000
Central by a certain deadline.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:26.000
We'll ask you to dispose of the inventory at your own expense if you miss that deadline.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:32.000
But also know that incorrect battery information can result in delayed or canceled shipments.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:39.200
Our team will review the requested information within two business days and let you know if we require

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.000
anything further.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.680
Products with lithium batteries don't always include battery information on their packaging, but

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:49.000
there are several ways you can check your product for battery details.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:55.955
You can inspect the battery for its composition details or look for them in its manufacturer's documentation,

00:01:55.955 --> 00:01:58.000
such as the product manual.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.000
You can also contact the supplier directly to find out what you need.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:06.000
Now let's review the most common types of lithium batteries.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:12.875
Lithium-ion batteries, also called Li-ion batteries, or LIBs, are rechargeable batteries that contain

00:02:12.875 --> 00:02:17.000
lithium compounds in a liquid solution that yield energy.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:24.143
Li-ion batteries are widely used in portable electronic products such as mobile phones, laptops,

00:02:24.143 --> 00:02:27.000
tablets, MP3 players, and cameras.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:34.742
Lithium-ion polymer batteries, often called lithium polymer, Li-poly, Li-pol, or Li-po batteries,

00:02:34.742 --> 00:02:41.968
are rechargeable batteries composed of several identical secondary cells that are connected in series

00:02:41.968 --> 00:02:43.000
and parallel.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:50.043
Li-poly batteries contain lithium compounds in a polymer gel-like solution and can have a more flexible

00:02:50.043 --> 00:02:52.000
design than lithium-ion batteries.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:57.000
Li-poly batteries also have less chance of overheating.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:02.000
These batteries are used in products similar to those with lithium-ion batteries.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:09.500
Finally, lithium-metal batteries contain metal compounds in a solid solution and are generally not

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:10.000
rechargeable.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:15.000
These batteries come in different shapes, including the flat, round batteries used in watches.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:20.000
They're also commonly used in products such as calculators and flashlights.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:26.500
For more information, search lithium batteries in Seller Central to find our help page titled Requirements

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:32.000
for Lithium Batteries and Products that are shipped with lithium batteries.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.000
This concludes our overview of lithium batteries.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:39.000
Thank you, and happy selling in the Amazon store.
